      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/2013860243952808282",
      "text": "[7:20AM] #LagBagagryExpWay\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nVery busy movement from Custom check point down to Ajibade/Odofa due to contraflow and ongoing road construction along the corridor. \n\nMovement is free from Odofa enroute Ibiye, Magbon , Okoafo, Elijah all the way to Badagry roundabout. \n\nMovement around Badagry roundabout is very good at the moment. \n\nThe return journey from the Roundabout back to Odofa is appreciable as well.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
